1140
01:14:08.350 --> 01:14:10.266
<i>has led to an escalation of violence,</i>

1141
01:14:10.350 --> 01:14:12.600
<i>with the situation now
completely out of hand.</i>

1142
01:14:12.683 --> 01:14:15.183
<i>It's just 24 hours
after the release of the video</i>

1143
01:14:15.266 --> 01:14:17.100
<i>showing the fatal attack on young Idir.</i>

1144
01:14:17.183 --> 01:14:19.350
<i>- The whole of France is now ablaze.</i>
- [PHONE RINGS]

1145
01:14:19.433 --> 01:14:23.100
<i>At least 30 cities are experiencing
unprecedented violence.</i>

1146
01:14:23.183 --> 01:14:24.766
<i>Police stations have been targeted,</i>

1147
01:14:24.850 --> 01:14:27.141
<i>as well as the mosques
in Roubaix and Colmar,</i>

1148
01:14:27.225 --> 01:14:29.100
<i>where buildings have been set on fire.</i>

1149
01:14:29.183 --> 01:14:32.516
<i>We've also just heard that a far-right
group of about 100 people</i>

1150
01:14:32.600 --> 01:14:34.350
<i>has stormed Dijon City Hall.</i>

1151
01:14:34.433 --> 01:14:38.058
<i>Throughout the country, the situation is
completely out of the police's control.</i>

1152
01:14:38.141 --> 01:14:41.725
<i>Sources have said
that the army may intervene...</i>

1153
01:14:41.808 --> 01:14:43.266
I'm sorry about your brothers.

1154
01:14:43.350 --> 01:14:46.100
<i>Over to our special correspondent,
Clément Lafont, live from Lille.</i>

1155
01:14:46.183 --> 01:14:48.433
[YELLING AND EXPLOSIONS ON TV]

1156
01:14:48.516 --> 01:14:51.183
[LAFONT] <i>Yes, it's chaos</i>
<i>here on the streets outside City Hall.</i>

1157
01:14:51.266 --> 01:14:53.641
<i>Hundreds of young people
have descended on the area...</i>

1158
01:15:06.225 --> 01:15:07.516
[HUMS SOFTLY]

1159
01:15:12.891 --> 01:15:13.891
Whoo!

1160
01:15:49.266 --> 01:15:50.725
[LAFONT] <i>Cars have been set alight,</i>

1161
01:15:50.808 --> 01:15:52.850
<i>stores have been looted,
and the local residents...</i>

1162
01:15:52.933 --> 01:15:55.242
- [WOMAN SHOUTING ON RADIO]
- [FIFOU] <i>Boys, come and help me.</i>

1163
01:15:55.266 --> 01:15:57.826
<i>I'm on the sixth floor with a dad
that won't leave his apartment.</i>

1164
01:15:57.891 --> 01:15:59.534
- [WOMAN] <i>No...</i>
- [RACHID] Yo, fuck, Abdel.

1165
01:15:59.558 --> 01:16:01.516
People don't wanna leave.
What do we do?

1166
01:16:01.600 --> 01:16:03.367
[LAFONT] <i>...by far the worst</i>
<i>in living memory...</i>

1167
01:16:03.391 --> 01:16:05.558
- Abdel?
<i>- While the police are doing their best...</i>

1168
01:16:05.641 --> 01:16:07.100
- Abdel!
- [GUNFIRE IN DISTANCE]

1169
01:16:07.183 --> 01:16:09.183
- [WOMAN SCREAMS]
- [GUNFIRE]

1170
01:16:10.350 --> 01:16:12.558
[GUNFIRE]

1171
01:16:12.641 --> 01:16:14.808
- Watch him!
- [GUNFIRE AND SCREAMING]

1172
01:16:19.850 --> 01:16:21.891
[WOMAN] Leave that!

1173
01:16:21.975 --> 01:16:23.891
[GUNFIRE]

1174
01:16:24.391 --> 01:16:25.850
[WOMAN] Stop shooting!

1175
01:16:26.725 --> 01:16:28.766
- [GUNFIRE]
- Hey! Stop it!

1176
01:16:29.475 --> 01:16:31.516
- Hey! Who told you to shoot?
- Sébastien told us.

1177
01:16:31.600 --> 01:16:33.475
- They can't attack then.
- Where'd he go?

1178
01:16:33.558 --> 01:16:35.798
[FIFOU] They're downstairs,
settin' up the gas cylinders.

1179
01:16:41.100 --> 01:16:42.766
Hey! No one's staying behind!

1180
01:16:42.850 --> 01:16:45.058
- Go downstairs! Go on.
- [MAN] Careful! Hey!

1181
01:16:45.141 --> 01:16:46.558
- [RESIDENT GASPING]
- [MAN] Easy!

1182
01:16:46.641 --> 01:16:48.933
- [BREATHING HEAVILY]
- [RIOTERS CHANTING]

1183
01:16:49.641 --> 01:16:51.433
- [MAN] I swear...
- ...not going anywhere...

1184
01:16:51.516 --> 01:16:53.058
- She's...
- I want her with me!

1185
01:16:53.141 --> 01:16:54.600
I'm not trying to take the piss...

1186
01:16:54.683 --> 01:16:56.100
- Come on, just get out.
- Fuck off!

1187
01:16:56.183 --> 01:16:58.076
- Hey, you have to go!
- We're not going anywhere!

1188
01:16:58.100 --> 01:16:59.784
- Just go quietly!
- What you doin' this for?

1189
01:16:59.808 --> 01:17:01.367
- Why should we go?
- What's the problem?

1190
01:17:01.391 --> 01:17:02.266
- Mum!
- Don't touch me.

1191
01:17:02.350 --> 01:17:04.600
- Take your kid, go!
- I said, don't fuckin' touch...

1192
01:17:04.683 --> 01:17:06.350
- Take your kids and go.
- I'm going!

1193
01:17:06.433 --> 01:17:07.933
Just go. Get out of here!

1194
01:17:08.558 --> 01:17:09.933
And stop fucking filming!

1195
01:17:11.850 --> 01:17:12.850
Sébastien!

1196
01:17:14.183 --> 01:17:15.266
[GRUNTS]

1197
01:17:17.933 --> 01:17:19.808
Repeat on every floor. Come with me.

1198
01:17:19.891 --> 01:17:21.016
[THUMPING]

1199
01:17:21.100 --> 01:17:22.350
[ABDEL] Sébastien!

1200
01:17:29.183 --> 01:17:30.225
Gas cylinder.

1201
01:17:39.350 --> 01:17:40.391
Gas cylinder.

1202
01:17:40.975 --> 01:17:42.058
Some fuel.

1203
01:17:49.600 --> 01:17:51.600
[HISSING]

1204
01:17:58.725 --> 01:17:59.725
Sébastien!

1205
01:18:00.516 --> 01:18:01.891
[RIOTERS CHANTING]

1206
01:18:02.475 --> 01:18:04.058
[HELICOPTER CIRCLING]

1207
01:18:13.391 --> 01:18:15.391
[SIRENS WAIL IN DISTANCE]

1208
01:18:28.308 --> 01:18:29.766
[PHONE RINGING]

1209
01:18:34.683 --> 01:18:37.159
[ABDEL'S BOSS] <i>Abdel, we're
bringing out the last families now.</i>

1210
01:18:37.183 --> 01:18:39.600
<i>You're on your own with the youths.
We're coming back.</i>

1211
01:18:40.100 --> 01:18:41.308
<i>Turn yourself in.</i>

1212
01:18:41.391 --> 01:18:42.433
Have you found them?

1213
01:18:43.308 --> 01:18:44.391
<i>Found who?</i>

1214
01:18:45.850 --> 01:18:48.058
[SIGHS] <i>Fuck, Abdel, they're not cops.</i>

1215
01:18:50.308 --> 01:18:51.433
Bring them.

1216
01:18:52.183 --> 01:18:53.725
You're going to have to bring 'em.

1217
01:18:54.225 --> 01:18:56.975
<i>We think they're far-right guys.
They're not our men.</i>

1218
01:18:57.641 --> 01:18:58.808
<i>It's over.</i>

1219
01:18:59.308 --> 01:19:00.516
Bring them or I'll do it.

1220
01:19:00.600 --> 01:19:02.881
<i>- Abdel, I don't think you understand...</i>
- Bring 'em here.

1221
01:19:02.933 --> 01:19:05.492
<i>- Listen. We led an investigation.</i>
- Bring 'em here. Bring 'em here.

1222
01:19:05.516 --> 01:19:07.451
<i>- We don't know...</i>
- Bring 'em here. Bring 'em here!

1223
01:19:07.475 --> 01:19:09.034
<i>- ...not proper uniforms...</i>
- Bring 'em here!

1224
01:19:09.058 --> 01:19:11.058
<i>- I don't know where they...</i>
- Bring 'em here!

1225
01:19:11.141 --> 01:19:12.701
<i>- Abdel, listen to me!</i>
- Do you hear me?

1226
01:19:12.725 --> 01:19:15.284
<i>- We don't know them! They're extremists!</i>
- [ROARS] Bring 'em here!

1227
01:19:15.308 --> 01:19:17.600
<i>-Calm down!</i>
Bring 'em here, I said!

1228
01:19:17.683 --> 01:19:20.683
<i>- The counter-terrorism guys will step in...</i>
- I'm gonna kill him.

1229
01:19:20.766 --> 01:19:22.141
[PANTING]

1230
01:19:22.225 --> 01:19:24.141
<i>- Don't do anything stupid.</i>
- I'm gonna do it.

1231
01:19:30.350 --> 01:19:32.266
[LIQUID POURING]

1232
01:19:38.433 --> 01:19:40.183
[PETROL CAN CLATTERS]

1233
01:19:40.266 --> 01:19:42.266
[BREATHING SHAKILY]

1234
01:19:45.141 --> 01:19:46.766
[LIFT DOORS OPEN]

1235
01:20:10.141 --> 01:20:13.641
[FIFOU] Hey, Sébastien. We've set up
all the gas cylinders. Now what?

1236
01:20:23.600 --> 01:20:25.350
[ABDEL BREATHING SHAKILY]

1237
01:20:32.641 --> 01:20:34.266
[LIFT DOORS OPEN]

1238
01:20:40.933 --> 01:20:42.641
[PHONE RINGING]

1239
01:20:49.350 --> 01:20:51.110
[ABDEL'S BOSS] <i>Hello, Abdel.</i>
<i>What's goin' on?</i>

1240
01:20:51.183 --> 01:20:52.183
[ABDEL] Film.

1241
01:20:53.016 --> 01:20:54.616
[JÉRÔME] Stop, Abdel!
What are you doing?

1242
01:20:54.683 --> 01:20:57.558
- [BOSS] <i>What are you doing?</i>
- It's all right! Stop, Abdel, I'm begging!

1243
01:20:57.641 --> 01:20:59.534
- Will you bring 'em here?
- [JÉRÔME] I'm begging!

1244
01:20:59.558 --> 01:21:01.117
- Will you or not?
- [JÉRÔME] I'm begging!

1245
01:21:01.141 --> 01:21:04.058
- [BOSS] <i>This isn't the time to lose it!</i>
- [JÉRÔME] I'm begging you!

1246
01:21:04.141 --> 01:21:06.266
- Abdel, no!
- [BOSS] <i>Abdel! You're out of control!</i>

1247
01:21:06.350 --> 01:21:07.867
- [JÉRÔME] Abdel!
- Will you bring them?

1248
01:21:07.891 --> 01:21:10.266
- [JÉRÔME] Please, let me go!
- Will you or not?

1249
01:21:10.350 --> 01:21:13.058
- I'm begging you, don't do it!
<i>- Don't do anything stupid, Abdel.</i>

1250
01:21:13.141 --> 01:21:15.659
<i>- Keep him alive. We'll come get him.</i>
- Will you bring those men?

1251
01:21:15.683 --> 01:21:17.641
[ROARS] Will you or not?

1252
01:21:17.725 --> 01:21:18.600
[BOSS] <i>No!</i>

1253
01:21:18.683 --> 01:21:21.808
- Abdel, please don't.
<i>- I won't, because they don't exist, okay?</i>

1254
01:21:21.891 --> 01:21:23.350
- Please don't do it.
<i>- Calm down.</i>

1255
01:21:23.433 --> 01:21:25.350
- It's not worth it. Enough.
<i>- Let go of him.</i>

1256
01:21:25.433 --> 01:21:27.183
- Abdel, that's enough!
<i>- Stop right now.</i>

1257
01:21:27.266 --> 01:21:29.808
-[JÉRÔME] Please, Abdel.
Enough, Abdel! <i>Putain,</i> enough!

1258
01:21:29.891 --> 01:21:31.531
<i>- Leave him alone.</i>
- [JÉRÔME] Please stop.

1259
01:21:31.558 --> 01:21:33.975
- Please.
- Come on. Stop, Abdel! Please stop, Abdel!

1260
01:21:34.058 --> 01:21:35.659
- I'm begging you! Don't do this!
- [ROARS]

1261
01:21:35.683 --> 01:21:37.242
- [RACHID] Fuck!
- [JÉRÔME] Stop, Abdel!

1262
01:21:37.266 --> 01:21:40.350
- [BOSS] <i>Abdel!</i>
- Please stop, Abdel! [SCREAMS]

1263
01:21:40.433 --> 01:21:42.100
- No!
- [ROARS]

1264
01:21:42.183 --> 01:21:45.100
- Don't fucking do it, Abdel!
- [BOSS YELLING] <i>Abdel!</i>

1265
01:21:45.183 --> 01:21:47.308
- [JÉRÔME SCREAMS] Don't do it!
- [FIRES GUN TWICE]

1266
01:21:54.058 --> 01:21:55.100
[BOSS] <i>Abdel.</i>

1267
01:21:56.725 --> 01:21:58.183
<i>- Abdel, can you...</i>
- [HANGS UP]

1268
01:22:06.225 --> 01:22:08.225
[MUFFLED BREATHING]

1269
01:22:08.308 --> 01:22:10.308
[HIGH-PITCHED RINGING]

1270
01:22:20.850 --> 01:22:22.850
- [SOUND BECOMES CLEAR]
- [BREATHING HEAVILY]

1271
01:22:38.100 --> 01:22:40.100
- [RIOTERS SHOUTING]
- [RUNNING FOOTSTEPS]

1272
01:22:46.016 --> 01:22:48.766
[FIFOU] You lot! Sébastien's downstairs,
he's gone fucking mental.

1273
01:22:48.850 --> 01:22:50.350
He wants to blow up the building!

1274
01:22:50.433 --> 01:22:52.266
- We gotta go! Come on!
- [WOMAN] Come on!

1275
01:22:53.183 --> 01:22:56.058
[RACHID] Yo, Abdel, let's go.
Come on. Abdel! We gotta go!

1276
01:22:56.683 --> 01:22:58.641
Fuck, come on, man! We can't stay here!

1277
01:22:58.725 --> 01:23:00.183
Fuck's sake, Abdel!

1278
01:23:00.266 --> 01:23:01.725
[RUNNING]

1279
01:23:02.683 --> 01:23:04.058
[FIFOU] Hey, wait for me!

1280
01:23:05.225 --> 01:23:07.225
[VOICES FADING]

1281
01:23:07.808 --> 01:23:09.808
[JÉRÔME SOBBING]

1282
01:23:12.683 --> 01:23:14.683
[MUFFLED WHIMPERING]

1283
01:23:16.266 --> 01:23:18.100
[MUFFLED SHOUTING IN DISTANCE]

1284
01:23:34.850 --> 01:23:36.850
[MUFFLED BREATHING]

1285
01:23:40.641 --> 01:23:42.641
[MUFFLED WHIMPERING]

1286
01:23:54.558 --> 01:23:56.558
[FOOTSTEPS FADING]

1287
01:24:09.725 --> 01:24:11.266
[EXHALES SHAKILY]

1288
01:24:11.350 --> 01:24:13.350
[HELICOPTER CIRCLES]

1289
01:24:23.933 --> 01:24:25.933
[MUFFLED BANGING]

1290
01:24:27.725 --> 01:24:29.100
[MUFFLED YELLING]

1291
01:24:54.850 --> 01:24:56.850
[MUFFLED HELICOPTER WHIRRING]

1292
01:24:57.475 --> 01:25:01.641
[MUFFLED YELLING]
Get down! Get on your knees!

1293
01:25:01.725 --> 01:25:03.141
Now! Get down!

1294
01:25:03.225 --> 01:25:04.933
Get on the ground, on your knees.

1295
01:25:05.016 --> 01:25:07.683
Come on. Move! Move!

1296
01:25:07.766 --> 01:25:09.284
- [DOG BARKING]
- [HELICOPTER CIRCLING]

1297
01:25:09.308 --> 01:25:10.683
Shut your mouth! No talking!

1298
01:25:10.766 --> 01:25:13.016
Hands behind your head.
Keep your eyes forward.

1299
01:25:13.100 --> 01:25:15.266
Show me your hands! Show me your hands!

1300
01:25:15.350 --> 01:25:17.600
Hands behind your head!
Hands behind your head!

1301
01:25:17.683 --> 01:25:19.391
Don't move! Don't move!

1302
01:25:23.766 --> 01:25:26.725
Hands behind your head!
Let's go, let's go!

1303
01:25:26.808 --> 01:25:29.350
Get down on your knees!
On your knees, now!

1304
01:25:30.475 --> 01:25:31.725
Eyes forward.

1305
01:25:33.725 --> 01:25:34.933
[GROANS]

1306
01:25:36.516 --> 01:25:39.641
[OFFICER] I'm watching you!
Don't try anything! Don't fucking...

1307
01:25:41.141 --> 01:25:43.350
Don't move! Hands behind your head!

1308
01:25:43.433 --> 01:25:44.850
[MUFFLED YELLING CONTINUES]

1309
01:25:59.266 --> 01:26:02.433
[SLOW, STEADY DRUMBEATS]

1310
01:26:11.016 --> 01:26:13.641
[OPERATIC CHORUS BUILDS]

1311
01:26:16.141 --> 01:26:18.100
[HISSING]

1312
01:26:41.308 --> 01:26:43.683
CIVIL WAR IN FRANCE

1313
01:27:13.558 --> 01:27:15.225
[BREATHES SHAKILY]

1314
01:29:04.141 --> 01:29:06.308
[HUBBUB OF VOICES]

1315
01:29:06.391 --> 01:29:07.975
[CHILD YELLING]

1316
01:29:08.058 --> 01:29:09.433
- [THUMP]
- Hey!

1317
01:29:09.516 --> 01:29:11.516
[RUNNING AND SCUFFLING]

1318
01:29:11.600 --> 01:29:13.600
- [CHILD YELLING]
- [MAN] Hey, <i>putain!</i>

1319
01:29:13.683 --> 01:29:14.891
- [THUMP]
- [CHILD YELPS]

1320
01:29:21.058 --> 01:29:23.058
[FOOTSTEPS]

1321
01:29:30.350 --> 01:29:31.808
[RUNNING AND SHUFFLING]

1322
01:29:33.016 --> 01:29:34.558
[VAN DOOR OPENS]

1323
01:29:38.891 --> 01:29:40.600
[VAN DOOR CLOSES]

1324
01:29:40.683 --> 01:29:45.433
[OPERATIC CHORUS PLAYS]

1325
01:31:40.350 --> 01:31:44.725
TO DJ MEHDI

1326
01:31:46.141 --> 01:31:51.558
IN MEMORY OF BERNARD MOUSSA GOMIS
